{
  "name": "Derivative steel, aluminum, and copper articles subject to 25% Section 232 duty (Proclamation 11021 Annex I-B)",
  "source": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/04/09/2026-06960/strengthening-actions-taken-to-adjust-imports-of-aluminum-steel-and-copper-into-the-united-states",
  "technical_corrections": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/04/29/2026-08297/notice-of-technical-corrections-to-the-harmonized-tariff-schedule-of-the-united-states-for-duties",
  "notes": [
    "Proclamation 11021 (April 2, 2026, effective April 6, 2026): 25% ad valorem on full customs value for derivative articles substantially made of steel, aluminum, or copper.",
    "Annex I-B includes: steel derivative articles (7321-7324, 8211, 8215, 8302, 8403-8433, 8450, 8451, 8482, 8483, 8501-8504, 8547, 8601-8609, 8701-8716, 9406); aluminum derivative articles (7615, 7616, 8302, 8414, 8415, 8418, 8419, 8467, 8503, 8544, 8708); and copper articles per Annex I-B (8544.42.10/20/90, 8544.49.10).",
    "Annex II codes (furniture: 9403.10/20, sports: 9506, 9507, fishing: 9507, electronics: 8473, 8486, 8517.79, 8529.97, 8541.90, 8807.30, 9031, 9401.99, seats: 9401.71/79, lighting: 9405.99, umbrella parts: 6603.90) are NOT subject to Section 232 and have been excluded from this file.",
    "Annex III codes (transitional 15% rate through Dec 31, 2027) are in a separate file: steel_aluminum_derivatives_annex_iii_04_02_2026.json.",
    "Metal content threshold (Annex IV): Articles not in chapters 72-76 must have metal weight \u226515% of total article weight to be subject to these duties.",
    "Note: Some codes appear in both steel and aluminum derivative sections of Annex I-B; the proclamation applies the 25% duty only once.",
    "Copper 8544 series (insulated wire/cable): Annex I-B copper articles (8544.42.10/20/90, 8544.49.10) at 25% on full customs value. Previously in copper_products_08_01_2025.json at 50%; reclassified per Annex I-B.",
    "Amended by Proclamation 11032 (June 1, 2026, effective June 8, 2026): added steel racks (9403.20.0075, 9403.20.0082, 9403.99.9040) and aluminum lithographic plates (3701.30.00) to Annex I-B at 25%. Agricultural equipment (8432, 8433.20/51/59/90, 8701 agricultural-use variants, 8716.80.10, 8716.90.10) and HVAC equipment (8415.10.60/90, 8415.81.01/82.01/90.80, and aluminum 8415.90.80xx) were moved from Annex I-B to Annex III (15%); those codes remain in this file but are overridden at 15% by ANNEX_III_SAC, which is loaded later in the pipeline."
  ],
